CodaLinux live image

  Graphical session: greetd starts Hyprland on tty1 (Wayland + XWayland)
  Rescue console:    tty2 autologin (root, empty password)
  Network:           systemd-networkd + iwd    (iwctl)
  Install:           coda-install
                     (archinstall + CodaLinux defaults; disk layout is interactive)

Locked stack: systemd-boot, ext4, official Arch repos only, no NetworkManager.
Decisions: DESIGN.md in the git tree. Support: https://github.com/codemodify/codalinux/issues
